<template><div><h1 id="wiki_chapter_3_setup">Chapter 3 Setup</h1><section><h2 id="details-setup">Story edition, lobby continuity and PaP schedule</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-edition" data-guide-step>Story chapter edition: the ordinary ten-wave objectives and the hidden sword-part route share a match. Pack-a-Punch batteries become available on waves 1, 4 and 7; the corresponding survival map uses 1, 5 and 10. Maintain the same returned lobby through all three hidden chapter routes. For the complete I Have the Power route, finish Into the Storm, select Across the Depths from the same lobby, then select Beneath the Ice after it. Leaving that lobby breaks continuity. Completing each chapter normally beforehand is the source author’s preparation recommendation, not a proven universal prerequisite.</li>
<li id="guide-step-battery-schedule" data-guide-step>Charge the ordinary Ubersprengen batteries with nearby kills: wave 1 at left-side Schnellblitz, wave 4 at Laufenblitz and wave 7 at right-side PaP. Each green light goes out and stops accepting energy when charged. These are separate from the hidden quest’s carried batteries. All three expose Pack-a-Punch.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0534.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0534.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Wave 1 PaP battery: left-side Schnellblitz&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Wave 1 PaP battery: left-side Schnellblitz&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0534&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0535.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0535.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Wave 4 PaP battery: Laufenblitz&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Wave 4 PaP battery: Laufenblitz&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0535&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0536.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0536.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Wave 7 PaP battery: right-side PaP&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Wave 7 PaP battery: right-side PaP&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0536&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-objective-schedule" data-guide-step>Keep checking the current wave’s objective and HUD deadline while following the secret route. Complete repair, defend, escort or marked-enemy tasks exactly as requested; failing an ordinary objective can end the run. The resupply drops after waves 3, 6 and 9 offer equipment and armour. Save enough Jolts to upgrade and refill before the wave-10 final enemy.</li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_sword_route">Sword Route</h1><section><h2 id="details-rune-wall">Waves 1–2: battery vision and first rune code</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-rune-battery" data-guide-step>Wave 1: melee the Forge battery three times to break it. It permits vision use every two waves after the break; breaking it on wave 1 gives even-wave opportunities. On wave 2 interact to enter vision; re-enter if its viewing time expires.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0599.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0599.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Forge vision battery&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Forge vision battery&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0599&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-rune-observe" data-guide-step>Search the fourteen photographed wall/ceiling positions in vision for the current complete rune sequence. Record its shape order or physical wall positions in stage 1 of the tool. Keep the clue landmark so a forgotten symbol can be re-read; do not replace missing symbols with a guessed fixed code.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0600.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0600.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Forge face statue underside&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Forge face statue underside&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0600&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0601.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0601.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Forge above LMG wallbuy&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Forge above LMG wallbuy&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0601&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0602.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0602.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;left-side Forge doorway&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;left-side Forge doorway&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0602&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0603.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0603.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Stamin-Up stair scaffold&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Stamin-Up stair scaffold&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0603&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0604.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0604.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Stamin-Up stair rock behind light&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Stamin-Up stair rock behind light&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0604&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0605.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0605.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Speed Cola battery ceiling&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Speed Cola battery ceiling&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0605&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0606.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0606.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;ceiling above Speed Cola stairs&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;ceiling above Speed Cola stairs&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0606&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0607.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0607.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Rune Room right of assault rifle wallbuy&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Rune Room right of assault rifle wallbuy&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0607&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0608.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0608.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Rune Room Electric Cherry stair top&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Rune Room Electric Cherry stair top&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0608&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0609.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0609.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;right-side Electric Cherry stair wall&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;right-side Electric Cherry stair wall&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0609&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0610.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0610.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;wall behind Electric Cherry&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;wall behind Electric Cherry&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0610&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0611.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0611.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;right-side Forge doorway ceiling&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;right-side Forge doorway ceiling&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0611&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0612.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0612.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;wall above SMG wallbuy&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;wall above SMG wallbuy&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0612&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0613.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0613.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;spawn wall left of Forge stairs&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;spawn wall left of Forge stairs&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0613&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-rune-input" data-guide-step>At Rune Room’s top wall, interact with the matching runes in the observed order. Electricity and an audio cue confirm acceptance. For a wrong entry, keep interacting with any rune until all depress briefly and rise again; only then begin a new attempt.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0614.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0614.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Physical rune wall&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Physical rune wall&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0614&quot;}]' /></li></ol><InlineTool tool="ww2-tortured-runes" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-hilt">Wave 3: mount the Hilt</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-ice-hilt" data-guide-step>The accepted initial code delivers a Hilt in the transition supply crate through Rune Room’s ceiling. Take it and fit it in the glowing Forge bowl. This is the quest crate, separate from ordinary supplies.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0615.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0615.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Forge Hilt bowl&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Forge Hilt bowl&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0615&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-flares">Wave 4: five bowls and the second code</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-ice-flares" data-guide-step>Take flares from the stair box between Spawn and Forge; they replace tactical equipment and you carry two at a time. Light the four bowls below Forge’s face statues, collecting more flares as needed. Then light the ground bowl near Stamin-Up where supplies fall.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0616.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0616.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Box of flares&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Box of flares&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0616&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0617.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0617.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Forge face-statue bowls&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Forge face-statue bowls&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0617&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0618.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0618.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Final ground flare bowl&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Final ground flare bowl&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0618&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-ice-second" data-guide-step>The wall left of Stamin-Up opens to an extra rune. Take it, fit it in Rune Wall and find a new code using vision. Record it in stage 2 with blank new slots, enter it and wait for the success cue. The old clue remains visible and is not the new answer.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0619.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0619.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Opened extra-rune wall&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Opened extra-rune wall&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0619&quot;}]' /></li></ol><InlineTool tool="ww2-tortured-runes" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-pommel">Wave 5: mount Pommel</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-ice-pommel" data-guide-step>On the next transition after the second accepted code, take Pommel from Rune Room’s quest crate and fit it in its glowing Forge bowl.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0620.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0620.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Forge Pommel bowl&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Forge Pommel bowl&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0620&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-sacrifices">Wave 5: all players on stones and the third code</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-ice-stones" data-guide-step>All players stand on sacrificial stones at the same time and kill nearby enemies until the completion sound. Keep standing through the charge; there is no useful filling meter, so listen for the success cue.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0621.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0621.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sacrificial floor stone&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sacrificial floor stone&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0621&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-ice-third" data-guide-step>Take the new rune from the Forge blood pool and fit it on Rune Wall. Find and enter another fresh code, recording it in tool stage 3. Preserve earlier sequences as history; do not carry them into the new stage by default.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0622.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0622.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Forge blood-pool rune&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Forge blood-pool rune&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0622&quot;}]' /></li></ol><InlineTool tool="ww2-tortured-runes" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-blade">Wave 6: mount Blade</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-ice-blade" data-guide-step>Take Blade from the next transition crate and fit it in the glowing Forge bowl. All three sword pieces must be visibly mounted.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0623.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0623.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Forge Blade bowl&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Forge Blade bowl&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0623&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-forge">Assemble the Sword of Barbarossa</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-ice-forge" data-guide-step>Interact with the Forge once all three pieces are fitted. Wait for it to finish and claim the Sword. Continue the ordinary objectives through the final encounter; forging alone is not the completed three-chapter campaign ending.</li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_chapter_ending">Chapter Ending</h1><section><h2 id="details-extraction">Wave 10: Guardian and campaign ending</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-ice-guardian" data-guide-step>Damage the Guardian while avoiding its slam and pulling attack. If it returns to Forge and drinks from the four hanging statues, shoot those statues to interrupt its healing. Keep damaging it until the final wave ends.</li>
<li id="guide-step-ice-complete" data-guide-step>A successful ending with the three hidden routes completed in continuous lobby order plays the campaign cutscene and unlocks the Sword-related rewards. The survival editions are separate endless maps; do not continue treating their wave 10 as this chapter’s extraction.</li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_side_quests">Side Quests</h1><section><h2 id="details-classic">Optional: The Classic from the random SMG wallbuy</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-ttp-classic" data-guide-step>On any chapter, drop 1,750 Jolts onto the flare where a resupply crate falls after wave 3, 6 or 9. The Classic enters the random SMG wallbuy pool for this match; it remains a possible result, not a guaranteed purchase.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-darkened-path">Optional: Darkened Path difficulty</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-ttp-darkened" data-guide-step>At Shattered Rank 50, the red skull at spawn offers Darkened Path: faster and tougher enemies with harder objectives. Activate that challenge only if intended before beginning the chapter’s timed secret route. Completing the full three-chapter quest in that mode awards the Sanguine Skull charm.</li></ol></section><section><h2 id="guide-sources">Sources and review</h2><p>Source-reviewed on 8 October 2026, using the references below and the research handoff. These instructions and puzzle calculations have software checks; they have not been verified in a complete in-game playthrough. Record symbols, sequences and completion cues from your match. Screenshot and community-chart creators are credited with each illustration.</p><ul><li><a href="https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/the_tortured_path_guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mmmrkennedy illustrated guide ↗</a></li>
